## Commands

- Setup: `<%= app_file?("bin/setup") ? "bin/setup" : "bundle install && bin/rails db:prepare" %>`
<% if profile.test_framework != :none -%>
- Run all tests: `<%= test_command %>`
- Run one test: `<%= (profile.test_framework == :rspec) ? "bundle exec rspec path/to/file_spec.rb:LINE" : "bin/rails test path/to/file_test.rb:LINE" %>`
<% end -%>
<% if lint_command -%>
- Lint: `<%= lint_command %>`
<% end -%>
<% if security_command -%>
- Security scan: `<%= security_command %>`
<% end -%>
<% if app_file?("bin/ci") -%>
- Full local CI (as configured in `config/ci.rb`): `bin/ci`
<% end -%>
- Console: `bin/rails console`
- Routes: `bin/rails routes -g NAME`
